WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:05.450
We're Master Glass Solutions, and we've
been doing glass in San Antonio since 2004.

00:00:06.490 --> 00:00:09.218
In homes, that's shower
enclosures, mirrors cut to

00:00:09.218 --> 00:00:12.110
fit the wall, and window
glass when something breaks.

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:17.830
For businesses, it's storefronts and entry
doors that get used all day, every day.

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:23.020
Inside, glass partitions that open a
space up instead of closing it off.

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:27.870
We do glass railings too, so you keep
the view on a stair or a balcony.

00:00:28.910 --> 00:00:32.180
And if glass breaks, we'll board
it up first, whatever time it is.

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.550
Master Glass Solutions. Give us a call.
